 "voice": "narrator",
 "text": "In the town of Emberhollow, third lantern past the fountain, there is a bookshop. It has stood since the Year of the Quiet Comet. Every folk in the realm comes through its door. Elves spend decades browsing the Arcana section. Dwarves weep quietly in Poetry. Halflings leave crumbs in Cookery, and are forgiven, because they bring scones. An orc warband's book club wants fourteen copies of the same romance, by Thursday. The tall shelves have ladders. The low shelves have cushions.",
